@CartPromotionEngine_HostAddress = http://localhost:5143
@cartId = e4b0f922-38ef-41ec-8178-57d627c28899

### 1. Get Empty Cart
GET {{CartPromotionEngine_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{cartId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Add First Item ($45.00 x 2)
POST {{CartPromotionEngine_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "7b0a1d68-1996-41ce-9812-9860b0e50882",
  "productName": "Ergonomic Mechanical Keyboard",
  "unitPrice": 45.00,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 3. Add Second Item ($25.00 x 1)
POST {{CartPromotionEngine_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "9c1a2e79-2007-42df-0923-0971c1f61993",
  "productName": "Wireless Gaming Mouse",
  "unitPrice": 25.00,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 4. Apply Coupon (SAVE10)
POST {{CartPromotionEngine_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{cartId}}/coupon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponCode": "SAVE10"
}

### 5. Checkout
POST {{CartPromotionEngine_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{cartId}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "123 Le Loi, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City",
  "paymentMethod": "CreditCard"
}
